LEVEL 2 — STRING PATTERNS WITH JAVA CODE
    1. TWO-POINTER STRING PROBLEMS
        a) Remove extra spaces from a string
        b) Remove all occurrences of a character
        c) Check if two strings are anagrams (sorting method)
        d) Check if two strings are anagrams (frequency method)
        e) Lexicographical (dictionary) comparison

    2. Sliding Window String Problems
        Sliding Window is used for
        🔹 longest substring
        🔹 smallest substring
        🔹 K-distinct chars
        🔹 repeating character problems
        a) Longest substring without repeating characters
        b) Longest substring with K distinct characters
        c) Smallest substring containing all characters of a pattern
        d) Find substring with exactly K vowels
        e) Longest substring with same characters after K replacements